title: Red Defense League 
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: iron_front_formed == 1 and iron_front_timer = 0
on-arrival: iron_front_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 1; rb_militarization_cost = 3 if rb_militancy > 0.25
card-image: img/iron_front.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism

= The Red Defense League

The Red Defense League is our new cross-party antifascist organisation, consisting of the KPD, RFB, affiliated trade unions and anyone committed to the communist cause in an attempt to overshadeow the Iron Front. How should we use the Red Defence League?

- @defense: Rally for defense against the Nazis and Stalheim as the RFB.
- @pacifism: Rally for pacifism, against nationalism and war.
- @republic: Rally to destabilise and oppose the republic.
- @wtb: Rally for communism and economic rejuvenation.
- @antisemitism
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ rb_militarization_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_strength += 50; rfb_militancy += 0.05; 

The Red Defence League rallies for militant action against the fascist paramilitaries, strengthening the RFB.

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5 if pacifism >= 3; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; unemployed_kpd += 4*(1-dissent)

The Red Defense League rallies against nationalism and warmongering.

@republic
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); democratization += 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; unemployed_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4

The Iron Front rallies in defense of the democratic republic and against dictatorship.

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted == 1
on-arrival: workers_spd += 8*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 8*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1-dissent);

Workers control over the economy is imperative of communism and thus the KPD, now including the Red Defence League.

@antisemitism
title: Rally against antisemitism and in defense of Jewish Germans.
view-if: confronting_antisemitism > 1
on-arrival: nationalism -= 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); confronting_antisemitism += 1; workers_nsdap -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_nsdap -= 4*(1-dissent);

# TODO
The Nazis and other far-right political movements are increasingly turning their hatred against the Jewish community of Germany. The Red Defense League rallies in defense of the Jewish community.
